1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,249
The sun is going down.

2
00:00:02,249 --> 00:00:04,755
It's almost bedtime for Mimzi.

3
00:00:05,305 --> 00:00:08,349
Teddy, is it bedtime already?

4
00:00:08,899 --> 00:00:10,814
Yes! Let's get ready!

5
00:00:12,164 --> 00:00:15,355
First, Mimzi puts her toys away.

6
00:00:15,905 --> 00:00:18,102
Good night, toys!

7
00:00:19,452 --> 00:00:22,857
Next, she puts on her cozy pajamas.

8
00:00:23,407 --> 00:00:26,451
My pajamas have little stars!

9
00:00:27,801 --> 00:00:30,254
Then she brushes her teeth.

10
00:00:30,504 --> 00:00:32,790
Brush, brush, brush!

11
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:37,970
Now it's story time.

12
00:00:37,970 --> 00:00:40,454
Mimzi picks her favorite book.

13
00:00:41,004 --> 00:00:43,262
Read it again, please!

14
00:00:44,612 --> 00:00:47,445
A big hug and a kiss good night.

15
00:00:47,995 --> 00:00:50,213
I love you, Teddy.

16
00:00:50,763 --> 00:00:52,981
I love you too, Mimzi.

17
00:00:54,331 --> 00:00:55,421
Lights off.

18
00:00:55,421 --> 00:00:57,212
The moon is shining.

19
00:00:57,462 --> 00:00:59,723
The stars are twinkling.

20
00:01:00,273 --> 00:01:01,798
Good night, moon.

21
00:01:01,798 --> 00:01:03,398
Good night, stars.

22
00:01:04,998 --> 00:01:10,189
Toys away, pajamas on, brush teeth, story, hugs, and sleep.

23
00:01:10,739 --> 00:01:12,699
Share Mimzi with a friend,

24
00:01:12,699 --> 00:01:15,334
and subscribe for more learning fun!

25
00:01:15,934 --> 00:01:17,530
Good night, friends.

26
00:01:17,530 --> 00:01:18,918
See you tomorrow!
